 "What is, is. What is not, is not. Everything else is opinion.": "",
 "I still say you never arrived. You just stopped departing.": "",
 "Master Parmenides is right, and I can prove it. Ask me how. Please ask me how.": "",
 "The doors were sealed at dusk and opened at dawn by Ariste.": "",
