 "If the vessel was gone from the inventory at dawn, but seen on the stand at dawn…": "",
 "…then one of the two is not what it seems.": "",
 "…then it was in two places at once.": "",
 "…then the witnesses are all lying.": "",
 "The three witnesses use the very same words. That means…": "",
 "…they are honest.": "",
 "…they saw the same thing, but not necessarily a real thing.": "",
 "…Ariste told them what to say.": "",
