 "Parmenides: “Judge by reason, not by your eyes.” Use the premises to rule out what cannot be.": "",
 "Parmenides nods. “The way of truth. The vessel on the stand is an appearance.”": "",
 "Yes. Go on.": "",
 "“That is the way of opinion,” says Parmenides. Think again.": "",
